# Candidate: rtx4080-r0.args with prefix caching on. On this hybrid (conv + GQA)
# model that is not a single engine change: vLLM 0.25.1 also switches the conv
# state cache to "align" mode (block-aligned chunking and state checkpoints)
# and sets mamba_block_size to the KV block size. The mode is written out so
# the diff shows the whole bundle.
